495
00:36:31,980 --> 00:36:33,620
We've just been looking in the wrong places.

496
00:36:37,120 --> 00:36:49,740
So, this morning I pray that both Christ crucified and Christ raised will help us identify where our values and the values of the kingdom are in contradiction with one another.

497
00:36:49,740 --> 00:36:58,840
