504
00:37:52,080 --> 00:38:01,240
That you're not inviting us as one individual out by ourself to go swim in the opposite current of the culture around us.

505
00:38:01,240 --> 00:38:04,480
You're actually inviting all of us as a group to swim in the opposite current together.

506
00:38:06,560 --> 00:38:13,320
God, give us power and strength and wisdom in the community to live your values.

507
00:38:13,320 --> 00:38:20,880
To be aware of where the values of this world have blended with a message of the gospel that we've received.

508
00:38:20,880 --> 00:38:22,180
God, challenge us, convict us.

509
00:38:22,180 --> 00:38:29,540
And for those of us that are just so discouraged already, God, remind us of the hope of the resurrection.

510
00:38:30,220 --> 00:38:32,300
That this suffering will not last.

511
00:38:32,300 --> 00:38:40,500
That it is light and temporary compared to the glory that will be revealed to us in Jesus.

512
00:38:40,500 --> 00:38:45,480
I pray all of this in Jesus' name.

513
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:46,360
Amen.

