00:41:26,660 --> 00:41:32,300
It's a reminder that Jesus invites us to meet him at the bottom of the ladder.

550
00:41:34,300 --> 00:41:42,900
So may this morning, this opportunity be for us to realign our lives with the values of God's kingdom seen clearly through Christ crucified.

